    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d308">

                <pb facs="0348" n="272" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg272"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 351.117/83</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Sharp to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 3231</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-05-25">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 25, 1916</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In compliance with the Department’s No.
                    1051 of April 25 directing me to inform the French authorities of the
                    citizenship of Armand Robert Garrot [etc.] I communicated with the Minister for
                    Foreign Affairs.</p>
                <p>The Minister has just replied that according to French law, Mr. Garrot is French,
                    being born abroad of a French father, and that the naturalization of the father,
                    having been made after the birth of the son, does not modify his origin.</p>
                <p>The Minister’s note, a copy and translation of which is enclosed,<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d308-f1"/> states that it is not possible to release Mr. Garrot from
                    military service for which he is held in France.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>For the Ambassador: <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Woods Bliss</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
